(7432375, 1174340, 114969, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tribute. It was a clever move to mix this background with a bird, it gives a sense of perpetual movement, full of life and dizziness. Congratulations on the ribbon as well!</td>', 'Wonderful tribute. It was a clever move to mix this background with a bird, it gives a sense of perpetual movement, full of life and dizziness. Congratulations on the ribbon as well!', '2016-01-27 12:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7432378, 1174346, 114969, '<td valign="top">Nice reminder of how poetry can take many shapes. It is always very, very hard to create funny images, and I have the greatest respect for that. Not mentioning you made me hungry: I''ll definitely have some soup tonight! And of course, congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Nice reminder of how poetry can take many shapes. It is always very, very hard to create funny images, and I have the greatest respect for that. Not mentioning you made me hungry: I''ll definitely have some soup tonight! And of course, congrats on the ribbon.', '2016-01-27 13:04:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7432379, 1174308, 114969, '<td valign="top">And you did this while traveling! Impressive, I wouldn''t even dare to try. Great results, the muted tones work wonderfully here. Congrats on the nice finish!</td>', 'And you did this while traveling! Impressive, I wouldn''t even dare to try. Great results, the muted tones work wonderfully here. Congrats on the nice finish!', '2016-01-27 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 0),
