erial for floors in Russia. Still, you got some love from the more seditious members here -  cutout and  posthumous like it, so it can''t be all bad.  Getting a Posty is a bit of a compliment so make sure you post it prominently on your user page! Please keep shooting and entering, Susan   OMG) I am so good, get award for my superbly work... how do I shared it in my page?', '2016-02-09 14:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7441749, 1174030, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a cool and fantastic idea Diane!!! Love the nod to the Andy Warhol soup cans that for me is a subtle nod to a line in David Bowie''s song a Space Oddity (For here, Am I sitting in a tin can Far above the world) The many changes (heh, Changes from Bowie) in colors and vibrancy represents the changes in that Bowie explored in his music and re-imagining himself over the years. I do have one suggestion that might have been a nice little touch to the imagery and that is changing out the inside of the campbell''s circle icon with Bowie''s Black Star icon from his last album and title song.</td>', 'This is a cool and fantastic idea Diane!!! Love the nod to the Andy Warhol soup cans that for me is a subtle nod to a line in David Bowie''s song a Space Oddity (For here, Am I sitting in a tin can Far above the world) The many changes (heh, Changes from Bowie) in colors and vibrancy represents the changes in that Bowie explored in his music and re-imagining himself over the years. I do have one suggestion that might have been a nice little touch to the imagery and that is changing out the inside of the campbell''s circle icon with Bowie''s Black Star icon from his last album and title song.', '2016-03-07 17:22:32.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
